  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Available Skills**\n\nI\'ve begun by meticulously analyzing the available skills. Specifically, I\'ve identified and marked \'ultra-mode\' as highly relevant and reviewed its documentation before proceeding with any code modifications. I am moving on to other skills.\n\n\n**Evaluating Design Integration**\n\nI am now evaluating the relevance of `design`. It seems crucial for crafting the landing page and workspace showcase for the \"METR Enterprise Resource Planning Platform,\" as specified in the PRD, TRD, and ERD. The `computer-use` skill is also relevant for validating the UI in a real browser. I\'ve noted that `applet-seo`, `cloudsql-*`, and `firebase-integration-rpc` are not requested for this task.\n\n\n"
