    content: "---\nname: Precision Ledger & Flow\ncolors:\n  surface: \'#FFFFFF\'\n  surface-dim: \'#cadaff\'\n  surface-bright: \'#f9f9ff\'\n  surface-container-lowest: \'#ffffff\'\n  surface-container-low: \'#f1f3ff\'\n  surface-container: \'#e8edff\'\n  surface-container-high: \'#e0e8ff\'\n  surface-container-highest: \'#d7e2ff\'\n  on-surface: \'#041b3c\'\n  on-surface-variant: \'#3e4947\'\n  inverse-surface: \'#1d3052\'\n  inverse-on-surface: \'#edf0ff\'\n  outline: \'#6e7977\'\n  outline-variant: \'#bdc9c6\'\n  surface-tint: \'#006a63\'\n  primary: \'#005c55\'\n  on-primary: \'#ffffff\'\n  primary-container: \'#0f766e\'\n  on-primary-container: \'#a3faef\'\n  inverse-primary: \'#80d5cb\'\n  secondary: \'#49607c\'\n  on-secondary: \'#ffffff\'\n  secondary-container: \'#c7dfff\'\n  on-secondary-container: \'#4b637e\'\n  tertiary: \'#005c52\'\n  on-tertiary: \'#ffffff\'\n  tertiary-container: \'#00776a\'\n  on-tertiary-container: \'#84ffeb\'\n  error: \'#ba1a1a\'\n  on-error: \'#ffffff\'\n  error-container: \'#ffdad6\'\n  on-error-container: \'#93000a\'\n  primary-fixed: \'#9cf2e8\'\n  primary-fixed-dim: \'#80d5cb\'\n  on-primary-fixed: \'#00201d\'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: \'#00504a\'\n  secondary-fixed: \'#d1e4ff\'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: \'#b0c9e8\'\n  on-secondary-fixed: \'#011d35\'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: \'#314863\'\n  tertiary-fixed: \'#62fae3\'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: \'#3cddc7\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: \'#00201c\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: \'#005047\'\n  background: \'#f9f9ff\'\n  on-background: \'#041b3c\'\n  surface-variant: \'#d7e2ff\'\n  canvas: \'#F5F7FA\'\n  muted-text: \'#526579\'\n  border-subtle: \'#E5EBF0\'\n  border-default: \'#D7E0E8\'\n  dark-surface: \'#0B1724\'\ntypography:\n  display:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 56px\n    fontWeight: \'800\'\n    lineHeight: 64px\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\n  display-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 36px\n    fontWeight: \'800\'\n    lineHeight: 44px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 40px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 48px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-lg-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 28px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 36px\n    letterSpacing: -0.015em\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 28px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 36px\n    letterSpacing: -0.015em\n  headline-sm:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 20px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  title:\n    fontFamily: Manrope\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n    letterSpacing: -0.005em\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 15px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  body-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 13px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\n  eyebrow:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 11px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.08em\n  tabular-data:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: \'500\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.25rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\n  md: 0.75rem\n  lg: 1rem\n  xl: 1.5rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  gutter: 1.5rem\n  gutter-mobile: 1rem\n  margin: 3rem\n  margin-mobile: 1.25rem\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\n  space-md: 1rem\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\n  space-xl: 2.5rem\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\n\n### Brand Personality & Core Ethos\nThis design system embodies finance-grade precision, operational discipline, systemic connectivity, and calm clarity. Designed for founders, operational executives, and financial leaders, the aesthetic rejects the neon gradients, playful blobbiness, and micro-animations of consumer software in favor of institutional trust, deliberate hierarchy, and uncompromised visibility. It balances the computational authority of a double-entry ledger with modern, humane clarity.\n\n### Visual Style Movement\nThe design movement is **Corporate Modern with High-Clarity Technical Restraint**. It avoids hyper-skeuomorphism and decorative glassmorphism. Surfaces are clean, architectural, and grounded by low-contrast borders, solid structural fills, high-contrast ink typography, and intentional dark-navy contrast anchors. Depth is communicated through calibrated surface layers rather than dramatic drop shadows.\n\n### Emotional Response\nInteractions evoke control, certainty, stability, and speed. Users experience zero cognitive friction or layout ambiguity; dense operational flows (such as Quote-to-Cash or Procure-to-Pay) feel systematic, traceable, and calm.\n\n## Colors\n\n### Hierarchy & Application Rules\n- **Primary Teal (`#0F766E`)**: Reserved strictly for high-priority interactive conversion elements (primary CTAs, key focus active states, validated inputs) and active navigation pills. Used with surgical restraint to maintain its semantic weight.\n- **Secondary Navy (`#102A43`)**: Provides executive authority and grounding. Utilized for major anchors, structural navigation bars, technical trust badges, and contrast-inversion sections (e.g., Trust & Infrastructure sections and global footer).\n- **Tertiary Mint (`#2DD4BF`)**: Functions strictly as an active flow accelerator\342\200\224directional node indicators, stage progress highlights in workflow pipes, and small high-visibility telemetry dots. It is never used as standard body or card background fills.\n- **Neutral Ink (`#172B4D`)**: The primary typographic voice, delivering optimal contrast against white cards and light canvas backdrops without the harshness of pure black.\n- **Canvas (`#F5F7FA`) & Surface (`#FFFFFF`)**: Establishes crisp spatial containment. Base canvases use muted gray-blue, while transactional workspaces, tables, and metric cards elevate to pure white surfaces bounded by structural borders.\n- **Dark Surface (`#0B1724`)**: Deepest contrast base for foundational security, audit log modules, and code-grade ledger views.\n\n## Typography\n\n### Structural Pairings & Rules\n- **Headings (Manrope, 600\342\200\223800)**: Manrope provides modern geometric precision with stable horizontal proportions. Headlines must use tight letter-spacing to deliver confident editorial and enterprise weight without feeling sterile.\n- **Body & Controls (Inter, 400\342\200\223700)**: Inter ensures legibility across complex multi-column tables, ERP schemas, data inputs, and high-density labels.\n- **Financial & Numerical Data**: All monetary quantities, inventory counts, audit dates, and ledger rows must activate font features `tnum` (tabular numerals) and `zero` (slashed or distinct zero) to ensure column alignment in dense operational views.\n- **Eyebrows & Metadata**: Uppercase micro-labels in 11px Inter Bold with `letterSpacing: 0.08em` are systematically used to categorize roadmap milestones, workflow states, and subsystem indicators.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\n### Grid Philosophy & Breakpoints\nThe layout adopts a disciplined **12-column fluid grid** constrained to a `1440px` maximum viewport on desktop to guarantee predictable reading lines and stable dashboard metrics.\n\n- **Desktop (1200px \342\200\223 1440px+)**: 12 columns, 24px (`1.5rem`) gutters, 48px (`3rem`) page margins. Hero visual splits 5:7 between text framing and live interactive dashboard previews.\n- **Tablet (768px \342\200\223 1024px)**: 8 columns, 20px gutters, 32px margins. Complex multi-node sequences reflow to 2x2 modular blocks or directional scroll bands.\n- **Mobile (375px \342\200\223 430px)**: 4 columns, 16px (`1rem`) gutters, 20px (`1.25rem`) margins. Multi-column cards stack strictly vertically into single-column layouts with edge-to-edge touch targets.\n\n### Spacing Cadence\nSpacing follows an exact 8px base rhythm (`0.5rem = 8px`, `1rem = 16px`, `1.5rem = 24px`, `2.5rem = 40px`). Form fields and card paddings strictly conform to internal tokens (`space-md` to `space-lg`), eliminating arbitrary gaps.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\n### Structural Tonal Stacking\nRather than depending on heavy diffuse shadows, elevation is achieved via **low-contrast architectural outlines and calibrated surface fills**:\n\n1. **Floor / Base Canvas (`#F5F7FA`)**: The foundation level of the operational workspace.\n2. **Elevated Surface (`#FFFFFF`)**: Primary functional containers, data cards, form groups, and dashboard panels sit on white surfaces bounded by a crisp 1px `#D7E0E8` structural border.\n3. **Ghost Elevation (Resting Cards)**: Surfaces use an ultra-subtle, ambient shadow:\n   `box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 42, 69, 0.04), 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 42, 69, 0.02)`.\n4. **Interactive Hover / Flyout**: Modals, dropdown pickers, and active workflow cards rise smoothly using:\n   `box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -4px rgba(16, 42, 69, 0.08), 0 4px 8px -2px rgba(16, 42, 69, 0.04)` with a shifted border tone to `#0F766E` at 20% opacity.\n5. **Dark Contrast Anchors (`#102A43` / `#0B1724`)**: Deep structural sections invert the color scheme, using `#172B4D` inner borders to establish depth without diffuse blur.\n\n## Shapes\n\n### Corner Geometry\nThe system employs **Rounded Level 2**, matching the balanced, purposeful geometry of modern business software:\n- Standard UI interactive components (buttons, input fields, badges): `0.5rem` (8px).\n- Functional cards, data grids, and modular panels: `rounded-lg` (`1rem` / 16px).\n- Large dashboard viewports and section containers: `rounded-xl` (`1.5rem` / 24px).\n- Status indicator tags and micro-pills: Full radius (`9999px`) where appropriate for tags.\n\n### Vector Details\nIn alignment with the brand monogram, line terminals on technical workflow nodes, timeline connectors, and process schematics use precise, rounded stroke caps (`stroke-linecap=\"round\"`) with an active stroke width calibrated to 2px or 3px relative to component scale.\n\n## Components\n\n### Buttons\n- **Primary Action**: Solid `#0F766E` background, `#FFFFFF` Inter SemiBold text, 8px border-radius (`0.5rem`), padding: 12px 20px. Hover: `#0D655E`. Active: `#0B544E`. Focus: 2px offset outline in `#2DD4BF`.\n- **Secondary Action**: Background `#FFFFFF`, 1px solid border `#D7E0E8`, text `#172B4D`. Hover: `#F5F7FA` surface with border tone `#526579`.\n- **Tertiary / Subtle**: Transparent background, text `#102A43`, hover background `#E5EBF0`.\n\n### Workflow Cards & Connectors (The \"Connected Movement\" Signature)\n- Horizontal pipeline cards representing lifecycle stages: **Lead \342\206\222 Quote \342\206\222 Order \342\206\222 Invoice \342\206\222 Payment \342\206\222 Ledger**.\n- Cards use `#FFFFFF` background with 1px `#D7E0E8` borders, padded with `1.25rem`.\n- Active stage lines are linked by 2px `#D7E0E8` connectors with a centered 8px circular node. When completed or active, lines illuminate to solid `#0F766E` with an interior accent pulse of `#2DD4BF`.\n- The terminal \"Ledger\" node features an authoritative navy-tinted tag indicating balanced double-entry validation.\n\n### Input Fields & Controls\n- **Inputs**: Background `#FFFFFF`, 1px solid `#D7E0E8`, 8px radius, text `#172B4D`, placeholder `#526579`. Height: 44px for accessible desktop/mobile touch targets. Focus state: 1px solid `#0F766E` with a 3px ring in `rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.15)`.\n- **Checkboxes & Radios**: 18px square/circle with `#D7E0E8` borders; selected state fills `#0F766E` with crisp white iconography.\n\n### Chips & Phase Indicators\n- **Phase 1 (Live/Core)**: Subtle Teal background (`rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08)`), text `#0F766E`, border `1px solid rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.2)`.\n- **Phase 2 (Roadmap/Operations)**: Subtle Blue/Navy background (`rgba(16, 42, 69, 0.06)`), text `#102A43`, border `1px solid #D7E0E8`.\n- **Phase 3 (Expansion)**: Neutral slate background (`#F5F7FA`), text `#526579`, border `1px solid #E5EBF0`.\n\n### Accordions (FAQ)\n- Clean, non-bordered horizontal cards separated by 1px `#E5EBF0` dividers.\n- Expansion triggers use bold Manrope titles (`18px`) that shift color from `#172B4D` to `#0F766E` when active, with smooth rotational chevron indicators.\n\n### Metric Cards\n- White surface, 16px corner radius, containing an upper eyebrow label (11px, `#526579`), a prominent Manrope numeral (28px tabular, `#172B4D`), and a bottom directional micro-badge (`#0F766E` or `#526579`) tracking period deltas."
    num_lines: 249
    num_bytes: 12220
    line_range_bytes: 12220
  }
}
