  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Admiring the Screenshot**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed with the hero screenshot, `r1-desktop-hero.png`. The typography is crisp, using Manrope, and the color palette is perfect\342\200\224Executive-grade! The use of Precision Ledger and Flow, with the teal, navy and mint connector dots, is simply spotless.\n\n\n**Refining the UI**\n\nI\'m now diving into the details. I\'m focusing on that top bar, nailing the Naira alignment. The `run-code` timing detail was a crucial catch. I realized a timing issue caused a test failure, stemming from the animation duration of `<AnimatePresence>`. Also, I\'m analyzing the hero screenshot, specifically looking for ways to elevate it. I have spotted two refinements for the top score, one of which involves fixing a wrapping issue in the proof strip to ensure it looks elegant.\n\n\n**Enhancing the Display**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on display improvements. I\'ve realized arranging the three metrics into a clean three-column inline grid will sharpen the visual presentation. Additionally, I\'ve identified two UI defects in the hero workspace. The first, a medium-priority defect, involves wrapping issues in the toolbar controls due to a long tab label. Shortening this label resolves the wrapping problem and keeps controls balanced. The second, a low-priority defect, concerns spacing in the Journey Switcher, affecting screen reader accessibility. I can fix this by adding a literal space.\n\n\n"
