  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Immaculate Design**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed by the clean module grid! The perfect spacing, typography, and color hierarchy immediately catch my eye. That active card\'s teal focus ring, along with those subtle \"Phase 1\" badges, and the clean bottom metadata presentation, all scream institutional enterprise design. The design is just beautifully uncluttered.\n\n\n**Refining Interaction Flow**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing a subtle UX detail from the desktop modules view. When a user selects a card, the Schema Inspector renders below the grid, potentially out of view if there are many modules. To enhance visibility, I propose implementing smooth auto-scrolling to the Schema Inspector upon selection, or alternatively, a clear indicator to guide the user\'s attention. I\'ve noted a round 1 critique for improvement.\n\n\n**Improving Toolbar Appearance**\n\nI\'ve tackled a wrapping issue in the hero workspace toolbar. The journal title was too long, forcing the toolbar to stack. My fix involved shortening the tab label to \"Double-Entry Journal\" and moving the journal ID to the table footer for a single-line, balanced layout on desktop. I also want to address the discoverability issue of the Schema Inspector.\n\n\\n\\n\nI\'m now focused on the Schema Inspector. I\'m implementing a smooth scroll to bring it into view upon module selection, which should significantly improve the user experience. I\'ll also add a clear indicator to the active card\'s footer.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "idn-avHuMsqzkdUPmLOGgAo"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15631387191479608741"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Fix Hero proof strip wrapping and keep Hero workspace toolbar controls on a single balanced horizontal row\", \"EndLine\":260, \"Instruction\":\"Convert Hero proof strip to clean 3-column layout and shorten Double-Entry Journal tab label so toolbar fits on one row\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"            {/* Quiet unboxed proof strip */}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-5 mt-2 border-t border-[#E5EBF0] grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-tabular\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"font-[Manrope] text-[20px] font-bold text-[#102A43] leading-tight\\\">\\n                  15\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[#526579] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  PostgreSQL Schemas\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"border-l border-[#E5EBF0] pl-4\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"font-[Manrope] text-[20px] font-bold text-[#102A43] leading-tight\\\">\\n                  108\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[#526579] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  Canonical Entities\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"border-l border-[#E5EBF0] pl-4\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"font-mono text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#0F766E] leading-[25px]\\\">\\n                  numeric(20,4)\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[#526579] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  Ledger Precision\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </motion.div>\\n\\n          {/* Right 7 Columns: Live Interactive METR Workspace Preview */}\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 18 }}\\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.5, delay: 0.08, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n            className=\\\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div\\n              className=\\\"metr-card rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full bg-white\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Interactive METR multi-entity ledger preview\\\"\\n            >\\n              {/* Workspace Top Chrome: Legal Entity Switcher & Fiscal Period */}\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-[#102A43] text-white px-5 py-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#172B4D]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                  <Building2 size={16} className=\\\"text-[#2DD4BF] shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] text-[#EDF0FF] whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                    Legal Entity Scope\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div\\n                    role=\\\"group\\\"\\n                    aria-label=\\\"Switch legal entity\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[0.5rem] bg-[#0B1724] p-0.5 border border-white/10\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {LEGAL_ENTITY_DEMOS.map((demo, idx) => (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={demo.id}\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleEntitySwitch(idx)}\\n                        aria-pressed={entityIndex === idx}\\n                        className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                          entityIndex === idx\\n                            ? \'bg-[#0F766E] text-white\'\\n                            : \'text-[#B0C9E8] hover:text-white\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {demo.shortName}\\n                      </button>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-mono font-tabular text-[#B0C9E8]\\\">\\n                  <span>{entity.fiscalPeriod}</span>\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#2DD4BF] font-semibold uppercase\\\">Period Open</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Connected Movement Status Rail */}\\n              <div className=\\\"px-5 py-3.5 bg-[#F5F7FA] border-b border-[#E5EBF0] flex items-center justify-between gap-2 overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center min-w-max\\\">\\n                  {MINI_CHAIN.map((step, i) => {\\n                    const reached =\\n                      i <= (paymentAllocated ? 5 : activeTab === \'ledger\' ? 5 : 3);\\n                    return (\\n                      <div key={step.key} className=\\\"flex items-center\\\">\\n                        <span\\n                          className={`text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                            reached ? \'text-[#0F766E]\' : \'text-[#526579]\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          {step.label}\\n                        </span>\\n                        {i < MINI_CHAIN.length - 1 && (\\n                          <span className=\\\"mx-2 flex items-center\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-[2px] w-4 sm:w-5 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full -ml-3 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#2DD4BF] ring-1 ring-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-[2px] w-2 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                          </span>\\n                        )}\\n                      </div>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono font-tabular text-[#526579] whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\">\\n                  {entity.invoiceNumber}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Workspace Body */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-5\\\">\\n                {/* Summary KPI Strip */}\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Document Total\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172B4D]\\\">\\n                      {entity.quoteTotal}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#526579] truncate\\\">\\n                      {entity.customerParty}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Invoice Status\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold text-[#0F766E]\\\">\\n                      {paymentAllocated ? \'Part Paid\' : \'Issued\'}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium font-tabular text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      {paymentAllocated\\n                        ? `Rem: ${entity.symbol}${entity.remainingAfterPayment}`\\n                        : `Order ${entity.orderNumber}`}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Ledger Balance \316\224\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div\\n                      className={`mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold ${\\n                        journalCheck.valid ? \'text-[#102A43]\' : \'text-[#BA1A1A]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {journalCheck.valid ? `${entity.symbol}0.00` : `${entity.symbol}-100.00`}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium font-tabular text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      {journalCheck.valid ? \'Double-Entry Verified\' : \'Posting Blocked (UAT-04)\'}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* View Mode Switcher & Interactive Proof Controls */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2.5\\\">\\n                  <div\\n                    role=\\\"tablist\\\"\\n                    aria-label=\\\"Workspace view tabs\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[0.5rem] bg-[#F5F7FA] p-1 border border-[#E5EBF0]\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n                      aria-selected={activeTab === \'ledger\'}\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'ledger\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                        activeTab === \'ledger\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white text-[#102A43] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,42,69,0.08)]\'\\n                          : \'text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Double-Entry Journal\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n                      aria-selected={activeTab === \'document\'}\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'document\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                        activeTab === \'document\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white text-[#102A43] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,42,69,0.08)]\'\\n                          : \'text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Quote & Invoice Lines\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setPaymentAllocated((prev) => !prev)}\\n                      className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[0.5rem] border border-[#D7E0E8] bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#172B4D] hover:bg-[#F5F7FA] hover:border-[#0F766E]/40 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <FileCheck2 size={13} className=\\\"text-[#0F766E]\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                      {paymentAllocated ? \'Reset Payment\' : \'Allocate Payment\'}\\n                    </button>\\n                    {activeTab === \'ledger\' && (\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setSimulateImbalance((prev) => !prev)}\\n                        className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[0.5rem] border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                          simulateImbalance\\n                            ? \'border-[#BA1A1A]/30 bg-[#FFDAD6]/40 text-[#93000A]\'\\n                            : \'border-[#D7E0E8] bg-white text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {simulateImbalance ? (\\n                          <>\\n                            <RotateCcw size={13} aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                            Restore Balance\\n                          </>\\n                        ) : (\\n                          <>\\n                            <ShieldAlert size={13} aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                            Test Imbalance Guard\\n                          </>\\n                        )}\\n                      </button>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\", \"StartLine\":83, \"TargetContent\":\"            {/* Quiet unboxed proof strip */}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-4 mt-2 border-t border-[#E5EBF0] flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#526579] font-tabular\\\">\\n              <span>\\n                <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#172B4D]\\\">15</strong> PostgreSQL Schemas\\n              </span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>\\n                <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#172B4D]\\\">108</strong> Canonical Entities\\n              </span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>\\n                <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#172B4D]\\\">numeric(20,4)</strong> GL Precision\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </motion.div>\\n\\n          {/* Right 7 Columns: Live Interactive METR Workspace Preview */}\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 18 }}\\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.5, delay: 0.08, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n            className=\\\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div\\n              className=\\\"metr-card rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full bg-white\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Interactive METR multi-entity ledger preview\\\"\\n            >\\n              {/* Workspace Top Chrome: Legal Entity Switcher & Fiscal Period */}\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-[#102A43] text-white px-5 py-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#172B4D]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                  <Building2 size={16} className=\\\"text-[#2DD4BF] shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] text-[#EDF0FF] whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                    Legal Entity Scope\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div\\n                    role=\\\"group\\\"\\n                    aria-label=\\\"Switch legal entity\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[0.5rem] bg-[#0B1724] p-0.5 border border-white/10\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {LEGAL_ENTITY_DEMOS.map((demo, idx) => (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={demo.id}\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleEntitySwitch(idx)}\\n                        aria-pressed={entityIndex === idx}\\n                        className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                          entityIndex === idx\\n                            ? \'bg-[#0F766E] text-white\'\\n                            : \'text-[#B0C9E8] hover:text-white\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {demo.shortName}\\n                      </button>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-mono font-tabular text-[#B0C9E8]\\\">\\n                  <span>{entity.fiscalPeriod}</span>\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#2DD4BF] font-semibold uppercase\\\">Period Open</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Connected Movement Status Rail */}\\n              <div className=\\\"px-5 py-3.5 bg-[#F5F7FA] border-b border-[#E5EBF0] flex items-center justify-between gap-2 overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center min-w-max\\\">\\n                  {MINI_CHAIN.map((step, i) => {\\n                    const reached =\\n                      i <= (paymentAllocated ? 5 : activeTab === \'ledger\' ? 5 : 3);\\n                    return (\\n                      <div key={step.key} className=\\\"flex items-center\\\">\\n                        <span\\n                          className={`text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                            reached ? \'text-[#0F766E]\' : \'text-[#526579]\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          {step.label}\\n                        </span>\\n                        {i < MINI_CHAIN.length - 1 && (\\n                          <span className=\\\"mx-2 flex items-center\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-[2px] w-4 sm:w-5 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full -ml-3 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#2DD4BF] ring-1 ring-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`h-[2px] w-2 ${\\n                                reached ? \'bg-[#0F766E]\' : \'bg-[#D7E0E8]\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            />\\n                          </span>\\n                        )}\\n                      </div>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono font-tabular text-[#526579] whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\">\\n                  {entity.invoiceNumber}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Workspace Body */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-5\\\">\\n                {/* Summary KPI Strip */}\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Document Total\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172B4D]\\\">\\n                      {entity.quoteTotal}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#526579] truncate\\\">\\n                      {entity.customerParty}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Invoice Status\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold text-[#0F766E]\\\">\\n                      {paymentAllocated ? \'Part Paid\' : \'Issued\'}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium font-tabular text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      {paymentAllocated\\n                        ? `Rem: ${entity.symbol}${entity.remainingAfterPayment}`\\n                        : `Order ${entity.orderNumber}`}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-[0.75rem] border border-[#E5EBF0] bg-[#F5F7FA]/60 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      Ledger Balance \316\224\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div\\n                      className={`mt-1 font-[Manrope] font-tabular text-[20px] font-bold ${\\n                        journalCheck.valid ? \'text-[#102A43]\' : \'text-[#BA1A1A]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {journalCheck.valid ? `${entity.symbol}0.00` : `${entity.symbol}-100.00`}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium font-tabular text-[#526579]\\\">\\n                      {journalCheck.valid ? \'Double-Entry Verified\' : \'Posting Blocked (UAT-04)\'}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* View Mode Switcher & Interactive Proof Controls */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div\\n                    role=\\\"tablist\\\"\\n                    aria-label=\\\"Workspace view tabs\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[0.5rem] bg-[#F5F7FA] p-1 border border-[#E5EBF0]\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n                      aria-selected={activeTab === \'ledger\'}\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'ledger\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                        activeTab === \'ledger\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white text-[#102A43] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,42,69,0.08)]\'\\n                          : \'text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Double-Entry Journal ({entity.journalNumber})\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n                      aria-selected={activeTab === \'document\'}\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'document\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold rounded-[0.375rem] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                        activeTab === \'document\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white text-[#102A43] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,42,69,0.08)]\'\\n                          : \'text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Quote & Invoice Lines\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setPaymentAllocated((prev) => !prev)}\\n                      className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[0.5rem] border border-[#D7E0E8] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#172B4D] hover:bg-[#F5F7FA] hover:border-[#0F766E]/40 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <FileCheck2 size={13} className=\\\"text-[#0F766E]\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                      {paymentAllocated ? \'Reset Payment\' : \'Allocate Payment\'}\\n                    </button>\\n                    {activeTab === \'ledger\' && (\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setSimulateImbalance((prev) => !prev)}\\n                        className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[0.5rem] border px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors whitespace-nowrap metr-focus ${\\n                          simulateImbalance\\n                            ? \'border-[#BA1A1A]/30 bg-[#FFDAD6]/40 text-[#93000A]\'\\n                            : \'border-[#D7E0E8] bg-white text-[#526579] hover:text-[#172B4D]\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {simulateImbalance ? (\\n                          <>\\n                            <RotateCcw size={13} aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                            Restore Balance\\n                          </>\\n                        ) : (\\n                          <>\\n                            <ShieldAlert size={13} aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                            Test Imbalance Guard\\n                          </>\\n                        )}\\n                      </button>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/apps/web/src/components/HeroSection.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Refining Hero proof strip and toolbar\", \"toolSummary\":\"Refine Hero proof strip and toolbar\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\257\032\n\254\032\001i\024}\023po\363|HcQ\277\251\370\267\242/\234\222%\241\274\341!U\240L\302A\016\2179\225G\001k\311\031\275\277\270\330lO%\360\277\322UZ9i\253:\031w\250\317\025\317\203\245\253M\271\352\361\334\221\255\247n\354\321\257-\255S\346\277\247\204\305%\365\374\004-\027?3\250\002\247]\376Iw\203\262\030,x\307\203\345\326\354\2719\244\353#\251\251Y0\263\236px\216i\257\357\254\235\263-\202\303\257\366\332x\223\017\346\263\365\n|\226\373\255\252\277\260\373\"\236\204\246\231\n\317\335\355\321\354\025\303\275\350\302\334rF\320:\032\036t\201\177\337\037l\207\t\b\357\364\321;\201\tu\265X\3001\212\226\236~Mx\326\002FB\240\vM\366\330\362\217iRC2\347\234\214\356\361|\324\266\332\334\317G\327\371mj\222\253\247\201w\314aA\332\315\376\030]\334\210\r\036\225\353\016F\342\334\353\026\312\224\245\225\312`5MH]\"\245\035\277\003\3069\257\030\251\200\271\203\334\207b\025\v\232\323\352\321\307.,\334\257\211\303\334\223\\v\027\330\f\371:\213\302\225c\265\tg\224]\"\312Xn\244\353\200,A\305\305\'{h\373\332\215MXOJ\341\336\226\243c\371\334M\306\022\331^\375\335k\367; y\241\362\025\374\005H\264ZeU\274\364\356\252\333\204\310p\356I\344\031\207\001\200\200\210\272\005X\237\325!\225\230\237\231\343\213&\032\237D\335\250\355\352\214\341\204\305\344\240B/\t\214w9\334\255\270\333c\303\203\b*\337\333\036\346\022\200\320\004\177\351\263\211\267\004\233\022\306\337\241\363)E\330iu\035\361\315\271\331\037\004\370\240\360v\370\337Ci\226ve\360\265\346\211\032#\216\371\'\364\305\002\276#\320\303\362wR\0246\030F\234\347-+\376\027\177\365\306`j\020H9\227\021TEp7\357\223\346u\a\304\371\352\2261\204\364u\256\023\214\226\254\361\345\351\340\357\316@ f\275\003\252\0304\337\224\b\321\303\247\355T)n\300\272\n\315(\246\323tA\030\233\fK\274\240\016z\311V\233\347+/\v\325\341P\037~m+\305\305p\tA\227\247\bW\214\302\277\253\244\350|/\251(\004\202\303\254\305\365\266&7\222.\315\265\241%\230\332\020`\304\033\004\030\351\344\266\276\025\371\242(\334\177\256\373`\341\346\200\365?