  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Mobile Clipping**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously inspecting the Round 2 screenshots, and `r2-mobile-hero.png` revealed a significant mobile clipping bug at the 390px edge! The 3-column Hero proof strip specifically highlights the issue, and I\'m using that image to confirm the bug as a result of that proof.\n\n\n**Addressing Mobile Clipping**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed two critical mobile clipping bugs at 390px. First, a numeric value (`numeric(20,4)`) overflows due to a layout mismatch (grid/padding/text). Secondly, the Legal Entity Scope bar\'s text and buttons overflow because the inner container lacks `flex-wrap`. I plan to surgically patch `HeroSection.tsx` and verify the fix quickly with a re-run of the build process and a mobile check.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "atr-aoKtDvTY7M8PgeCW4QY"
