  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Original Request (Turn 1 \342\200\224 Completed)**: Build the **METR Enterprise Resource Planning Platform** web application matching the attached `Precision Ledger & Flow` design system (`/public/assets/aistudio/Image_3_f639e618.markdown`) and `METR-SPEC-001` PRD/TRD/ERD specification (`/public/assets/aistudio/METR_ERP_PRD_TRD_ERD_v1.0_f9384833.pdf`), structured to match the monorepo blueprint (`apps/web`, `packages/ui`, `packages/contracts`, plus Express + Vite `server.ts` on port 3000) with Motion (`motion/react`) scroll/entry animations and modular components (Hero with live interactive ledger preview, Connected Movement workflow pipeline, filterable Modules Grid with schema inspector, Dark Navy Architecture & Trust section, Roadmap Milestones/Vertical Slices, FAQ accordion, and validated Waitlist form).\n   - **Current Follow-Up Request (Turn 2 \342\200\224 Code & Verification Completed; Ready to Respond)**:\n     - User attached `/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg` (saved in workspace at `/public/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg`) and highlighted two UI elements via Focus Mode CSS selectors (both with empty `CSS 1: {}` / `CSS 2: {}` blocks):\n       1. `div#root:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > header:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > a:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(1) > svg:nth-of-type(1) > rect:nth-of-type(1)` (header logo SVG in `Navbar.tsx`)\n       2. `div#root:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > footer:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(1) > svg:nth-of-type(1) > path:nth-of-type(1)` (footer logo SVG in `Footer.tsx`)\n     - User asked: *\"Use this attached svg to replace these 2 highlighted elements. Apply style changes to the selected element(s).\"*\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Skills & Files Read**:\n     - Turn 1: Read `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/2_landing_marketing.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`, `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`, `/public/assets/aistudio/Image_3_f639e618.markdown`, and `/package.json`.\n     - Turn 2: Read `/skills/system_skills/focus_mode/SKILL.md` and `/public/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg` (`viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"`, single rounded-cap `#0F766E` stroke path).\n   - **Completed Edits (Turn 1)**:\n     - Configured `/metadata.json`, `/index.html`, `/tsconfig.json`, `/vite.config.ts`, `/package.json`, `/src/index.css`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/server.ts`.\n     - Built `/packages/contracts/src/erp.ts`, `/packages/contracts/src/index.ts`, `/packages/contracts/src/erp.test.ts`.\n     - Built `/packages/ui/src/tokens.ts`, `/packages/ui/src/index.ts`, and components (`BrandMark.tsx`, `Button.tsx`, `PhaseBadge.tsx`, `MetricCard.tsx`, `Accordion.tsx`, `WorkflowPipeline.tsx`, `Reveal.tsx`).\n     - Built `/apps/web/src/data/metrContent.ts`, `/apps/web/src/AppPage.tsx`, and components (`Navbar.tsx`, `HeroSection.tsx`, `ConnectedWorkflowSection.tsx`, `ModulesGridSection.tsx`, `ArchitectureTrustSection.tsx`, `RoadmapSection.tsx`, `FaqSection.tsx`, `WaitlistSection.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`).\n   - **Completed Edits (Turn 2)**:\n     - Surgically updated `/packages/ui/src/components/BrandMark.tsx` (the sole component rendering both highlighted header and footer SVG marks): replaced the inline `<svg>` with `<img src=\"/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg\" alt=\"\" width={28} height={28} aria-hidden=\"true\" className={...} />`, applying `brightness-[1.75] saturate-[1.15]` when `inverted` is true so the `#0F766E` mark renders with high contrast in bright teal against the `#102A43` dark navy footer.\n   - **Completed Verification After Final Turn 2 Edit**:\n     - `compile_applet`: **Passed** (\"Build succeeded - the applet is compiled\").\n     - `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`): **Passed** (0 errors).\n     - `npx --yes tsx --test packages/contracts/src/erp.test.ts`: **Passed** (5/5 tests pass).\n     - `restart_dev_server`: **Succeeded**.\n     - Browser verification via `playwright-cli` at `1440x900` (`f1-header.png` and `f1-footer.png`):\n       - Verified exactly 2 `<img src=\"/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg\">` elements exist and both loaded cleanly (`complete === true && naturalWidth > 0`).\n       - Visually inspected both `f1-header.png` (crisp teal mark beside `METR` on white header) and `f1-footer.png` (crisp luminous teal mark beside `METR` on `#102A43` dark navy footer).\n       - Console check: `Errors: 0, Warnings: 0`.\n       - Browser session closed cleanly (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`).\n   - **In Progress / Remaining**: None \342\200\224 only outputting the final concise summary to the user remains.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - `BrandMark` in `/packages/ui/src/components/BrandMark.tsx` is exclusively used in `Navbar.tsx` (`<BrandMark />`) and `Footer.tsx` (`<BrandMark inverted />`), matching the exact two CSS selectors highlighted by the user.\n   - Vite automatically serves `/public/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg` at `/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg` in dev and copies it to `dist/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg` in production builds.\n   - Because the attached SVG stroke is `#0F766E`, applying `brightness-[1.75] saturate-[1.15]` only for the `inverted` footer variant preserves direct asset path referencing while ensuring crisp legibility against the `#102A43` dark navy footer background.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Turn 1 (All Resolved)**:\n     - Playwright test timing on `<AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\">` stage switch (`Goods Receipt` text check ran before exit animation completed) \342\206\222 fixed test script to use `waitFor({ state: \"visible\" })`.\n     - Playwright monorepo assertion looked for literal `packages/ui/` instead of tree text \342\206\222 fixed assertion to `\"Precision Ledger & Flow tokens\"`.\n     - Visual defects found in Round 1/2 screenshots (hero proof strip wrapping with orphan separator dot at 1440px, workspace toolbar wrapping onto 2 rows, module schema inspector opening below fold, missing screen-reader space in `J-01 Lead-to-Cash` button, and 390px mobile right-edge clipping on proof strip and legal-entity bar) \342\206\222 all fixed in `HeroSection.tsx`, `ConnectedWorkflowSection.tsx`, and `ModulesGridSection.tsx`, and verified in follow-up screenshots.\n   - **Turn 2**: Zero errors encountered; build, lint, unit tests, and browser visual checks all passed on the first run.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server (`tsx server.ts` on port 3000) is running the latest compiled code with the updated `BrandMark.tsx`.\n   - No background tasks or Playwright browser sessions are left open.\n   - All files are clean and verified after the last edit.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Do NOT make further code edits or run redundant verification commands** \342\200\224 all edits, compilation, linting, unit tests, and browser visual checks for Turn 2 already passed after the final edit.\n   2. Immediately deliver a concise, honest summary to the user confirming:\n      - Both highlighted brand marks (in the top navigation header and footer) were replaced with the attached SVG asset (`/assets/aistudio/metr-mark_85805334.svg`), with contrast adjustment applied on the dark navy footer variant for legibility.\n      - What was verified (`compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, 5/5 contract unit tests, and headless Chromium desktop verification of both header and footer renders with 0 console errors).\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - **Focus Mode**: Only the targeted elements (`BrandMark` SVG in header and footer) were modified; no unrelated styling or files were touched.\n   - **Communication Style**: Concise, scannable overview on completion with no hype, no raw internal details, and honest reporting of what was verified.\n   - **Identity Boundary**: Never mention assistant identity, platform, or underlying models in app copy.\n</summary>"
