  user_input {
    user_response: "This landing page looks nice and solid. However, there are many little elements that show the technical stuff like SQL, API and tech stack related elements and entities which might confuse the non-tech savvy customers. What we can do is to make those mentioned entities to be translated to simple business terms that customers can understand. Also this landing page seems to reference many different pages the pdf document I shared earlier(for example the components that show \"CRM-01, SAL-01, FIN-01, etc). I think we should remove them to make the pages not to look overcrowded. The design and elements of the page are all good so it works well."
    items {
      text: "This landing page looks nice and solid. However, there are many little elements that show the technical stuff like SQL, API and tech stack related elements and entities which might confuse the non-tech savvy customers. What we can do is to make those mentioned entities to be translated to simple business terms that customers can understand. Also this landing page seems to reference many different pages the pdf document I shared earlier(for example the components that show \"CRM-01, SAL-01, FIN-01, etc). I think we should remove them to make the pages not to look overcrowded. The design and elements of the page are all good so it works well."
