      command {
        instruction: "Update ConnectedWorkflowSection to remove Section A6 & A7, J-01/J-02/J-03 codes, CRM-01/SAL-01/FIN-01 codes, REST endpoints, and outbox event keys, replacing them with plain-English business workflow cards."
