  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Presentation**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased with the current visual state! Each section feels clean, executive, and highly scannable. I\'m focusing on a detailed review of each screenshot, starting with `s1-hero.png`. The clean `3METR` logo and well-defined navigation links like `Workflows`, `Modules`, and `Security` stand out clearly.\n\n\n**Refining Key Messaging**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics for `Roadmap`, `FAQ`, and `Join Waitlist`. The `MULTI-ENTITY ERP PLATFORM` eyebrow, replacing the old code, works well. The proof strip features `12 Business Modules`, `Multi-Entity Companies & Currencies`, and `100% Auto-Balanced Books`.  The `Company Workspace` preview is also getting a fresh look. I\'m excited about `s2-workflow.png`, and the `Lead-to-Cash` and `Procure-to-Pay` sections, which are looking better with each pass. Finally, `s3-modules.png` shows promise with its module card layout.\n\n\n**Evaluating Trust Features**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the trust elements. `s4-trust.png` is particularly compelling, showcasing a dark navy band with four clear business pillars on the left and interactive governance tabs on the right, all backed by reassuring cards below. I\'m focusing on the clear presentation of the four assurance categories. Finally, I\'m examining the rollout plan visuals in `s5-roadmap.png`.\n\n\n"
